Source: debian-config-system-hardening
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: curtistinkers <curtistinkers@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/curtistinkers/debian-config-packages.git

Package: debian-config-system-hardening
Architecture: all
Depends: apparmor, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Generic baseline system hardening for Debian
 Provides universal system security hardening applicable to both server
 and desktop deployments. Configures kernel self-protection parameters,
 disables core dumps, and enforces AppArmor dependencies.
